{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","title":"WebAuthn.Extension.PRF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PRF"}],"externalID":"s:7YubiKit8WebAuthnO9ExtensionO3PRFV","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PRF"}],"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"symbolKind":"struct","extendedModule":"YubiKit"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/PRF"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PRF"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This WebAuthn extension wraps the CTAP2 hmac-secret extension, transforming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PRF secrets into hmac-secret salts using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" + secret)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Simple-Usage-single-credential","text":"Simple Usage (single credential)"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(session: session)","let ext = try prf.getAssertion.input(first: userSecret)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(parameters: params)","if let secrets = try prf.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Multi-credential-Usage-evalByCredential","text":"Multi-credential Usage (evalByCredential)"},{"code":["let prf = try await WebAuthn.Extension.PRF(","    first: defaultSecret,","    evalByCredential: [credIdA: (secretA, nil), credIdB: (secretB, nil)],","    session: session",")","","\/\/ After credential selection:","let ext = try prf.getAssertion.input(for: selectedCredentialId)","let params = CTAP2.GetAssertion.Parameters(..., extensions: [ext])","let response = try await session.getAssertion(parameters: params)","if let secrets = try prf.getAssertion.output(from: response) {","    \/\/ Use derived keys","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pseudo-random function extension for deriving symmetric secrets bound to a credential."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PRF"},{"text":" lets a relying party derive deterministic symmetric secrets from a credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"— the same input produces the same output every time the user authenticates with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that credential. It’s the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for credential-bound key derivation, built on the CTAP2 ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hmac-secret"},{"text":" extension.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The SDK transforms each PRF input with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" || input)"},{"text":" before","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sending it to the authenticator — that domain separation is mandated by the spec.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In a high-level WebAuthn flow, configure ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PRF"},{"text":" per ceremony via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf","isActive":true},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf","isActive":true},{"text":"; outputs come back on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"clientExtensionResults"},{"text":" of the corresponding ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Response"},{"type":"text","text":". Registration enables"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PRF on a credential, optionally deriving secrets at the same time on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticators that support hmac-secret-mc. Authentication evaluates the PRF at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one or more inputs and returns the derived bytes."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Registration: enable PRF on the new credential","let regOpts = WebAuthn.Registration.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rp: .init(id: \"example.com\", name: \"Example\"),","    user: .init(id: userId, name: \"alice@example.com\"),","    extensions: .init(prf: .enable)",")","let registration = try await client.makeCredential(regOpts, authorization: auth).value","","\/\/ Authentication: derive a secret bound to the credential","let authOpts = WebAuthn.Authentication.Options(","    challenge: challenge,","    rpId: \"example.com\",","    allowCredentials: [.init(id: storedCredentialId)],","    extensions: .init(prf: .eval(first: encryptionSeed))",")","let assertions = try await client.getAssertion(authOpts, authorization: auth).value","let derived = assertions.first?.clientExtensionResults.prf?.results.first"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For multi-credential flows where each credential needs different inputs, populate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extensi